@lingfengmow/dsh-vault README · 6.5 Encryption and credentials (two modes · three key slots)：**Default behaviour**: with no password supplied it generates a compliant random one, adds a recovery-code slot and a
local passwordless slot, and **shows all three exactly once without writing them anywhere** (persisting requires
`--write-key`).

